> Trace the source four-bin coupling architecture

Each source conditioner is 1->16 tanh->11:16 hidden weights,16 hidden biases,
176 head weights and 11 head biases,219 stored values. Four give 876; global
log_scale adds two. The total is **878 values in 17 tensors**. Hidden W uses
normal deviation .3 and bias .05; heads use deviation .01 and zero bias. Source
seed9803 warms forward blocks0..3 then the global scale. The optional TensorFlow
initial-array directory is absent, so the original auto default selects this
native initialization. The executed graph groups two couplings per stage,
438 actual values each, and two in the global scale.

Each 11-head row supplies four width logits, four height logits and three
interior derivative logits. On[-4,4], declared sizes are
8*(.01+.96*softmax(logits)); the implementation accumulates source-order knots
and returns their actual adjacent differences. Interior slopes use
.001+softplus(raw+offset), with offset=Float32(log(expm1(.999))) before any
promotion. The public primitive defaults to Double offset precision; the source
model explicitly selects rounded mode. Zero heads are near identity with
floating rounding, including small Double deviations in source-rounded mode.
Public widths/heights are bin sizes, whereas the original archives name these
fields coupling_scale/coupling_shift. They are not affine log scales or shifts.

```{cpp, results="markdown", file="figures/spline_network.svg", flags="-std=c++23 -O2 $(pkg-config --cflags --libs datamunge) -Wl,-rpath,$(pkg-config --variable=libdir datamunge)"}
#include <dm/dm.hpp>
int main(){
 namespace n=dm::nn;n::ParameterStore p(9803);
 n::Module model([&](const n::Tensor& x){auto o=n::models::SplineDensity(p,x);
  n::model_stage("Spline couplings 0 / 1",x,o.coupling1);
  n::model_stage("Spline couplings 2 / 3",o.coupling1,o.unscaled);
  return n::model_stage("Positive diagonal scale",o.unscaled,o.latent);
 },"Spline flow: 878 values / 17 leaves");
 n::ModelPlotOptions options;options.detail=n::ModelPlotDetail::Blocks;options.sizing.minimum_extent=2;options.sizing.max_planes=2;
 auto figure=model.plot(n::zeros({1,2}),options);
 if(figure.parameter_count()!=878||p.size()!=17)throw std::runtime_error("Executed Spline flow census");
 figure.save_svg("build/spline_network.svg");
}
